#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
msgid ""
"A very long expedition that triples the time limit.  Missions and exits will "
"be very far away.  You will have time for extended activities, but a good "
"deal of your time will be spent trying to reach objectives over potentially "
"dangerous terrain.  Missions offer even more warp shards as rewards."
