#. ~ Description of "Alpha Secure Container"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid ""
"The most secure storage possible, even if it is tiny.  This metaphysical "
"container is unique in that it is the only storage that will keep its "
"contents on death.  Everything else will still be lost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Security Alpha"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid ""
"You have come into possession of a tiny, ethereal storage container that "
"cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 500 mL and will bring items back"
" to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr ""

